window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Caelan is the mortal son of the great god, Donus. But is he ready for the chaos he is destined to tame? He doesn't think so. In fact, he doesn't even know about his destiny, even though the rest of the township knows it all too well.</p> <p>Is he ready to save the world? Or will the half-god fail his township and his absent father to be a normal boy instead?</p>"; 
